    "q-133263": {
      "dom_id": "question-133263",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14157242/assets/2ee258ce570d5afc7a014eece4d759c074fbc2dc618fea1eccf26be502ed6e0d.png)     \n                                \n                            \n\n   \n\n                            Debbie is Fred's neighbor. She has a plot of land whose area is ${x}^{2}-9$ square meters and whose width is $x+3$ meters, as depicted above. What is the length of Debbie's plot in terms of $x?$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        Debbie's plot has a length of\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \nmeters.",
      "worked_solution": "To find the length of Debbie's plot of land, we need to factor the expression ${x}^{2}-9.$\n\nFirst, we write the expression as a difference of squares:\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}-9={x}^{2}-{3}^{2}\n$$\n\nThen, we factor the expression using the difference of squares formula:\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}-{3}^{2}=(x+3)(x-3)\n$$\n\nAs a result, we conclude that the length of the plot must be $x-3$ meters.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14157242/assets/fec51af6e1d422bb55951e72a328c9b6d7555197303349bbbec9352434aac196.png)",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
