    "q-133406": {
      "dom_id": "question-133406",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "What is the degree of the polynomial that represents the area of Emma's plot of land?\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        Degree $\\,=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "The polynomial \n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+3x-10\n$$\n\ncan be written as\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+3{x}^{1}-10{x}^{0}.\n$$\n\nSo, it has the exponents $2,$ $1,$ and $0.$ The degree is the largest of these exponents, which is $2.$",
