    "q-133273": {
      "dom_id": "question-133273",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "If $x=20\\,\\text{m},$ what is the area of Emma's land plot?\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        Area $\\,=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n${\\text{m}}^{2}$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the area, we have to evaluate the polynomial ${x}^{2}+3x-10$ at $x=20.$\n\nSo, we substitute $x=20$ into the polynomial and simplify: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+3x-10 & = \\\\ (20)^{2}+3(20)-10 & = \\\\ 400+60-10 & = \\\\ 450\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area is $450\\,{\\text{m}}^{2}.$",
